{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"So yall know... A while back i duscussed an idea with radar:\n```we need a single mod, that will control some sort of info broker npc..... we tell them nothing that isn't public knowledge. tell them to make up believable facts/rumors they sell to players that we send their way or seek them out. sometimes they might hit truths, and we could if needed give them correct info, but otherwise its just them trying their best to make people believe they are telling truths (the npc would always believe the info they are passing on as truth, cause they got the info from various sources)```\n\nAfter hearing Lucky was wanting to play an info broker, I talked to him, and hes taknig on the role with his PC.  I hope we can give him a little leeway with having meta knowledge (like if people were talking about something in a town square he might have heard they were interested in it) and he can make up the info to pass along to them.  Likewise, he becomes a good source for us to feed small hints to the players about stuff (so you could DM him and let him know one of his contacts tells him about XYZ).","created_at":"2021-02-25T18:33:37.802000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"814565788177530891","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"<:dewit:755553364690862150>","created_at":"2021-02-25T18:34:45.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"814566071364485150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
