{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"can you open up the document outline in the following link, click on the various headings, and within the weeks, you should see links to the encounters ive built, let me know if those links jump you to the encounter? Ive been worknig on formatting the doc so that others could easily navigate it <https://docs.google.com/document/d/1J_ex2QXbL5UvrkZZgxw7N62vulHzZm51ekxn6ZZKYIc/edit?usp=sharing>","created_at":"2021-02-25T20:33:37.165000Z","edited_at":"2021-02-25T20:34:05.355000Z","id":"814595984495214632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"<@&746935788431867956> \nSo I was talking to radar about consequences of being brought back from the dead, since it will be more available this season, through multiple sources.  Originally I was discussing ideas specific to Hampstead, and we came up with something that might be a good consequence for the entire server, and kinda want your opinions.\n```As being brought back from the dead is a taxing ordeal that can cause confusion to the individual, we want to represent this in game.  So anytime a character comes back from the dead, for 24 hours, they can not communicate in common at all (minor aphasia affecting common).  Any other language works normally that they know.  After 24 hours they can communicate in very basic terms and ideas when using common.  36 hours after that, and they can speak fine once again.```\n \nThis would be in addition to any specific consequences your Burroughs's methods might bring back the dead.","created_at":"2021-02-26T03:14:27.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"814696860623175700","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
